---
import { pathWithBase } from '../data/site';
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div>
      <a class="brand footer-brand" href={pathWithBase('/')}>
        <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
        <span>低延迟实验室</span>
      </a>
      <p>游戏卡顿时，帮你找到下一步该检查什么。</p>
    </div>

    <nav aria-label="页脚导航">
      <a href={pathWithBase('/about/')}>关于本站</a>
      <a href={pathWithBase('/methodology/')}>测试说明</a>
      
      <a href={pathWithBase('/privacy/')}>隐私说明</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="footer-disclosure">
      <p>测试结果只能帮助排查，不能单凭 Ping 数值确定故障来自哪里。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-bottom">
    <span>© 2026 低延迟实验室</span>
    <span>需要进一步帮助时，请联系游戏客服或宽带运营商。</span>
  </div>
</footer>
